        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present No. 19 Woodvale Avenue to the Dublin 15 market, a superb TURN KEY three-bedroom semi-detached family home, further enhanced by a spacious Kitchen Extension and Attic Conversion. Ideally positioned within the popular Woodvale development, this impressive property is perfectly located close to a wide range of local amenities. Families will benefit from excellent access to nearby schools, shops and recreational facilities, while Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, Connolly Hospital and the National Aquatic Centre are all within easy reach. The property is also exceptionally well connected from a transport perspective, with a choice of bus routes nearby, easy access to the M50 motorway and Clonsilla Train Station just a short distance away.\nInternally, the bright and spacious accommodation extends to approximately 120 sq. m. and is thoughtfully laid out to provide excellent living space for modern family life. The welcoming entrance hallway leads into a cosy living room to the front, and brings you into the beautifully designed kitchen extension, complete with a modern fitted kitchen, feature island and dedicated dining area. The extension also incorporates a second living room/lounge to the rear, featuring a cosy stove, creating a versatile and inviting space that is ideal for both everyday family living and entertaining.The first floor comprises three spacious and well-proportioned bedrooms, providing comfortable accommodation for family members or guests, together with the main family bathroom. Continuing to the attic conversion with velux windows and excellent natural light, this additional room offers endless possibilities and could comfortably serve as a fourth bedroom, home office, study, playroom, gym or creative space. Externally, the property boasts a low-maintenance rear garden, with convenient side access leading to the front driveway, which provides valuable off-street parking.\nNo. 19 Woodvale Avenue comes to the market in turn-key condition, with the kitchen extension and attic conversion already completed, making this an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, growing families or those looking for a ready-to-move-into home in a highly sought-after Dublin 15 location. Early viewing is highly recommended. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to register your interest.\nAdditional Features:\n• TURN KEY 3 Bedroom Semi-Detached Home\n• Stylish kitchen extentsion\n• Feature kitchen island and stove fire\n• Attic Conversion acting as a 4th bedroom\n• Living room and lounge\n• c. 120 Sq m\n• Double glazed windows throughout\n• Gas central heating\n• BER E\n• Gated side access\n• Front driveway for off-street parking\n• Ideally located\n• Popular location\n• Close to amenities\n• Clonsilla Train station in close proximity\n• Enquire today to arrange a viewing\nDirections:\nEircode = D15 R8HC"
      },
